      "html": "<p>SafetyCulture (now Mitti) and Quickler do different jobs. SafetyCulture is a tool your team drives. Quickler does the write-up a person would otherwise spend hours on. We make Quickler, so read this with that in mind. We have kept to what SafetyCulture publishes about itself, and we say where it is the better choice.</p>"
